{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02729",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 9.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.47,
      "end_seconds": 14.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 15.52,
      "end_seconds": 24.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, what was I saying, good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.13,
      "end_seconds": 29.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "So, absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 30.66,
      "end_seconds": 34.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "We came because of seeing flashing lights."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.34,
      "end_seconds": 38.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.36,
      "end_seconds": 45.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had it it for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.7,
      "end_seconds": 49.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.35,
      "end_seconds": 51.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Mostly severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.52,
      "end_seconds": 56.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.93,
      "end_seconds": 62.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "okay, so it usually comes with swollen face and hands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.06,
      "end_seconds": 66.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.09,
      "end_seconds": 70.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.35,
      "end_seconds": 73.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "how about leaking fluid?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.1,
      "end_seconds": 77.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Definitely no leaking fluid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.55,
      "end_seconds": 82.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "have you had any reduced baby movements or vaginal bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.47,
      "end_seconds": 89.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, none that that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.98,
      "end_seconds": 94.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Yes. What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.04,
      "end_seconds": 99.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Actually, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.51,
      "end_seconds": 116.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.86,
      "end_seconds": 126.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Migraines, for nearly five years. I've had heart failure for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.11,
      "end_seconds": 131.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Ah. Alright, migraines, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.19,
      "end_seconds": 147.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.49,
      "end_seconds": 153.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.92,
      "end_seconds": 159.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Right, what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.9,
      "end_seconds": 163.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.65,
      "end_seconds": 167.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.67,
      "end_seconds": 171.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, um, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.68,
      "end_seconds": 187.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.13,
      "end_seconds": 201.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Ah, it's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed. Mm, uh, I take carvedilol, 6.25 milligrams, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.57,
      "end_seconds": 206.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.84,
      "end_seconds": 219.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.67,
      "end_seconds": 252.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 75, height 184 centimetres, respiratory rate 14, pressure 147 over 94, temperature is 36.5 degrees, weight 64 kilos, BMI works out to 18.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.12,
      "end_seconds": 258.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.18,
      "end_seconds": 261.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.7,
      "end_seconds": 265.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.17,
      "end_seconds": 280.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very high and your reflexes are brisk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.44,
      "end_seconds": 292.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Taking everything into account, the most likely explanation is severe pre-eclampsia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.52,
      "end_seconds": 296.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.18,
      "end_seconds": 330.06,
      "duration_seconds": 31.88,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now severe pre-eclampsia is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'll request a urine protein test, it'll help with pre-eclampsia. I'm going to order urgent blood tests, for pre-eclampsia. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Let's use labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now, single dose. That should help with severe hypertension. You need to go to the maternity unit straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.44,
      "end_seconds": 345.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.81,
      "end_seconds": 347.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.08,
      "end_seconds": 351.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "We'll catch up straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.54,
      "end_seconds": 353.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.71,
      "end_seconds": 357.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.43,
      "end_seconds": 360.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.54,
      "end_seconds": 363.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
